review_comments.body:
Rather than re-implementing `getData()` and `getMetadata()` here, it makes more sense to create private functions with the shared parts of those then this function becomes something like:

```java
Path path = getPath(key);
ObjectMetadata metadata = getMetadataInternal(path);
return new DataWithMetadata(getDataInternal(path), metadata);
```

And then move the shared code between this and `getData()` and `getMetadata()` to that internal function so that these stay in sync.

